<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head', { meta }) %></head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<main class="container" style="max-width:870px;padding-top:66px;padding-bottom:90px;">
  <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--accent-soft);">MABRIG TECHNOLOGIES · BUSINESS ENQUIRIES</div>
  <h1 style="margin:12px 0 20px;">How we handle business enquiries</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);">Effective November 4, 2026. This notice covers enquiries through the MABRIG Technologies business page, not the separate terms of other MABRIG platforms.</p>
  <section style="padding:28px 0;">
    <h2>What happens when you ask for a quotation?</h2>
    <p>The quotation form prepares a WhatsApp message on your device. We do not automatically save the form in our website database. The message is sent only if you choose to send it through WhatsApp. WhatsApp processes it under its own terms.</p>
  </section>
  <section style="padding:28px 0;">
    <h2>Information we may record</h2>
    <p>After you contact us, an authorised administrator may manually record your business name, contact details, requested service, market, source of enquiry, brief, quotation and manually confirmed payments to communicate and manage a potential or existing contract.</p>
    <p>Please do not send ID numbers, passwords, card details or sensitive personal information through the enquiry form.</p>
  </section>
  <section style="padding:28px 0;">
    <h2>Sharing, security and retention</h2>
    <p>We use hosting, database and communications services needed to operate this website and respond to enquiries. We do not sell the information from business enquiries or automatically publish it. Administrator access is restricted, but no online service can promise absolute security.</p>
    <p>We keep records as needed to respond to requests, manage agreements and meet applicable obligations. There is not yet an automated retention or deletion schedule for these manually entered records.</p>
  </section>
  <section style="padding:28px 0;">
    <h2>Your enquiries about your information</h2>
    <p>To request access, correction or deletion of information submitted to us, contact <a style="color:var(--accent-soft);" href="mailto:mabrig@mabrigkorie.org">mabrig@mabrigkorie.org</a> or <a style="color:var(--accent-soft);" href="https://wa.me/2347065342818" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp +234 706 534 2818</a>. We may need to verify that the request relates to your own records and retain information where necessary to meet applicable obligations.</p>
  </section>
  <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/business">← Return to Business Services</a></p>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
